  "question": {
    "text": "Let the coordinates of two points <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> be <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> respectively. The line <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is rotated through <math><mn>315</mn><mo>°</mo></math> in clockwise direction about the point of trisection of <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> which is nearer to <math><mi>Q</mi></math>. The equation of the line in the new position is"
  },
